{
  "case_id": "polish-combo-rtl",
  "group": "polish",
  "path": "/polish/combo-rtl.html",
  "description": "RTL sticky header covers the top of a windowed row. A transparent overlay does not take hits; its pointer-events:auto chip does, and that chip is not a hit against the overlay. A static flex item with z-index paints above the later sibling it overlaps.",
